  "description": "Martin Scofield’s a lone werewolf who was born a highly breedable “snow.” To avoid being used, he spent years on the run, taking odd jobs to survive. On the other hand, Daniel Sinclair was lovingly raised by two phantom vampires until a certain hunter killed them in cold blood and left him orphaned. When the two unknowingly reunite centuries later, Martin’s mission to avoid love and Daniel’s mission to avenge the only love he knew get sidelined as something much deeper develops between them.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
